# Clean URLs are real directories (privacy/index.html etc.), served by
# directory index — no rewrite rules needed for them.
# .html URLs redirect to the clean form; /download-apk redirects to the APK.
/ini-cet    /inicet    301
/ini-cet/    /inicet    301
/index.html    /    301
/privacy.html    /privacy    301
/terms.html    /terms    301
/mock-test.html    /mock-test    301
/admin-mock.html    /admin-mock    301
/neet-ss-books.html    /neet-ss-books    301
/landing.html    /landing    301
/download-apk    /MedLadder-latest.apk    302
# Unknown URLs now return a real 404 (404.html) instead of the SPA shell.
# NOTE: Workers Static Assets _redirects only accepts 200/301/302/303/307/308,
# so a 404 cannot be forced here. It is not needed: not_found_handling
# ("404-page" in wrangler.jsonc) already serves 404.html for unknown URLs, and
# the /.well-known/ JSON documents are served directly as static assets
# (verified live 2026-11-09: /.well-known/ai-catalog.json returns real JSON).
